Why: After a Notepad or Settings launch did not answer within 15 s, the refusal of a later launch that finds a window of that app says why it stays and what ends it: Windows may have opened that window for the earlier launch afterwards, nothing ties it to that launch (the app runs the user's windows in the same process), so the helper never treats it as its own, and every launch of that app is refused until no window of it is open.

